- Array.prototype.map: use ArraySpeciesCreate instead of hardcoded ARRAY alloc;
  use array_set_elem_ulong_checked for CreateDataPropertyOrThrow semantics;
  set result length to source length (ArrayCreate contract)
- Array.prototype.filter: use ArraySpeciesCreate instead of hardcoded ARRAY alloc;
  use array_set_elem_ulong_checked for CreateDataPropertyOrThrow semantics
- array_set_elem_ulong_checked: when value is undefined and target is ARRAY/ARGUMENTS,
  use put_prop to create a named property instead of writing to dense slot —
  dense undefined == hole so the element would appear absent

